---
import '../styles/global.css';
interface Props { title: string; description?: string; fullscreen?: boolean }
const { title, description = 'Gemlik ve Mudanya kıyısında meralar için saatlik LRF av puanı.', fullscreen = false } = Astro.props;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="tr" data-app="av-livn">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0e1c27" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icons/icon-192.png" />
    <title>{title}</title>
  </head>
  <body class:list={{ fullscreen }}>
    <header class="site">
      <div class="wrap">
        <a class="brand" href="/">av<span>.</span>livn</a>
        <nav aria-label="Ana menü">
          <a href="/" aria-current={Astro.url.pathname === '/' ? 'page' : undefined}>Liste</a>
          <a href="/harita/" aria-current={Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/harita') ? 'page' : undefined}>Harita</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>
    <main><slot /></main>
    <footer class="site">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p>Model v2.0: habitat uygunluk indeksi (HSI). Kanıt: 45 parametreden A 3, B 1, C 41; çoğu sezgisel ve av günlüğüyle kalibre edilecek. Ayrıntı: <a href="https://github.com/LiVNLOUD/av-livn/blob/main/docs/MODEL.md">MODEL.md</a>, <a href="https://github.com/LiVNLOUD/av-livn/blob/main/docs/RESEARCH.md">kaynaklar</a>. Denize çıkmadan önce hava durumunu ve güvenliği kendiniz kontrol edin.</p>
        <p>Tür: istavrit, LRF. Veri: <a href="https://open-meteo.com/">Open-Meteo</a> (CC BY 4.0) ve DWD ICON, <a href="https://marine.copernicus.eu/">Copernicus Marine Service</a> (Karadeniz/Marmara 500 m), <a href="https://emodnet.ec.europa.eu/en/bathymetry">EMODnet Bathymetry Consortium (2024): EMODnet Digital Bathymetry (DTM 2024)</a>, EMODnet Seabed Habitats (EUSeaMap 2025), © <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">OpenStreetMap</a> katkıcıları, <a href="https://openfreemap.org">OpenFreeMap</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
    <script>
      if ('serviceWorker' in navigator && location.hostname !== 'localhost') {
        // A new deploy installs a new worker that claims the page; reload once so HTML and assets match.
        const hadController = !!navigator.serviceWorker.controller;
        let reloaded = false;
        navigator.serviceWorker.addEventListener('controllerchange', () => {
          if (hadController && !reloaded) { reloaded = true; location.reload(); }
        });
        navigator.serviceWorker.register('/sw.js', { updateViaCache: 'none' }).catch(() => {});
      }
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
